---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {taxSources} from '../lib/tax-view-data';
import {devolved} from '../lib/devolved';
const sources=taxSources();
---
<BaseLayout title="Council tax data downloads" description="Download sourced council tax figures, source editions and checksums. Understand the licence, precision and limitations." path="/data/">
<header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Evidence you can reuse</p><h1>The data behind the pages</h1><p class="lede">Published charges, traceable source files and explicit coverage.</p></header>
<div class="task-nav"><a class="card" href="/downloads/england.csv" download><strong>England charges CSV</strong><span>7,104 rows: 296 billing authorities × 8 bands × 3 years. Annual pounds, GSS codes, charge basis and source links.</span></a><a class="card" href="/downloads/sources.json" download><strong>Source manifest and devolved data</strong><span>Source URLs and SHA256 file checksums. Includes all imported Scottish bands and Welsh Band D figures.</span></a></div>
<section class="section"><h2>England source editions</h2>{Object.entries(sources).map(([year,s])=><div class="card"><h3>{year.replace('-','/')}</h3><p><a href={s.url}>{s.title}</a> · {s.table}</p><details><summary>Original files and checksums</summary><ul>{s.files.map(f=><li><a href={f.url}>Download original workbook</a><br/><code class="hash">{f.sha256}</code></li>)}</ul></details></div>)}</section>
<section class="section"><h2>Scotland and Wales source editions</h2>{devolved.editions.map(e=><div class="card"><h3>{e.nation} {e.year.replace('-','/')}</h3><p><a href={e.source.url}>{e.source.title}</a> · {e.table} · precision: {e.precision}.</p><details><summary>Original file and checksum</summary><a href={e.source.fileUrl}>Download original workbook</a><p><code class="hash">{e.source.sha256}</code></p></details></div>)}</section>
<div class="prose"><h2>Reuse and interpretation</h2><p>Official data is reused under the <a href="https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/">Open Government Licence v3.0</a>. Attribute the original publisher and edition. Site calculations, including percentage changes and scenarios, are labelled separately.</p><p>Amounts are before household discounts and premiums. Do not treat area averages as address-level bills. Missing bands are not calculated from ratios. Scottish charges exclude water and sewerage. Welsh figures preserve the whole-pound display precision of Table 1.</p><p><a href="/methodology/">Read the methodology</a> · <a href="/coverage/">Check coverage before comparing</a></p></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.hash {overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal;} .section>.card {margin-bottom:1rem;}</style>
